  Inside   formatTemperature(inside_temp)  sub "Outside: " + formatTemperature(outside_temp)
  Odometer formatDistance(odometer, precision 0)
  Charger  charging ? fmtInt(charger_power)+" kW" (success) : "Not charging" (muted) ; sub "Full in {fmtNumber(ttf)}h"
  Sentry   sentry ? "Active" (danger) : "Off" (muted)
All eight web t() keys resolve through the P1/S10 facade; the web-hardcoded words
(Driving/Parked/Not charging/Active/Off + the "Full in" template) are routed through the
facade too — no English literals in Swift code. Data binds through the P1/S8 state-holder
seam (TelemetryGridSource); the view performs no I/O.

